<view class="page logout-page"><view class="logout-card"><view class="logout-title">退出登录</view><text>仅退出此手机会清除本机登录状态，服务器令牌按原有效期失效；个人资料和联系人保留。若需撤销所有设备的服务器令牌，请使用下方操作。</text><view class="logout-actions"><button class="cancel" bindtap="cancel">取消</button><button class="confirm" loading="{{loggingOut}}" bindtap="confirmLogout">退出此手机</button></view><button class="ui-secondary logout-all" bindtap="logoutAll" disabled="{{loggingOut}}">退出所有设备的在线登录</button><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="app-state app-state--error">{{error}}</view></view></view>
